OL,3,GNEWSAInvestigation after man raped in
OL,4,Askate park
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are investigating after a man
OL,7,Fwas raped in a skate park in Droitwich
OL,8,FSpa.
OL,10,FThe incident happened in the
OL,11,FWorcestershire town at about 06:30 GMT
OL,12,Fon Monday.
OL,14,FThe victim, a man in his 20s, is being
OL,15,Fsupported by specially trained officers
OL,16,Fwhile inquiries continue, said West
OL,17,FMercia Police, who appealed for
OL,18,Fwitnesses.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
